#: addon\globalPlugins\freeradio\radioDialog.py:8794
msgid "Add Custom Station"
msgstr "បន្ថែមស្ថានីយ៍វិទ្យុផ្ទាល់ខ្លួន"

#. Translators: Label for the custom-station name field.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeradio\radioDialog.py:8798
msgid "Station name:"
msgstr "ឈ្មោះស្ថានីយ៍វិទ្យុ:"

#. Translators: Label for the custom-station stream-URL field.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeradio\radioDialog.py:8803
msgid "Stream URL:"
msgstr "Stream URL:"

#. Translators: Button label; opens Radio Browser's own website to submit this station to their public directory (separate from just adding it locally to FreeRadio).
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeradio\radioDialog.py:8817
msgid "Add to &Radio Browser directory…"
msgstr "បន្ថែមទៅក្នុងថតឯកសារ &Radio Browser…"

#. Translators: Button label; confirms and adds the custom station to favourites.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeradio\radioDialog.py:8822
msgid "&Add"
msgstr "បន្ថែម &A"

#. Translators: Status text shown next to the Test URL button when it's pressed with an empty URL field.
#. Translators: Spoken alongside the status text above.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeradio\radioDialog.py:8845
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeradio\radioDialog.py:8847
msgid "Please enter a URL first."
msgstr "សូមបញ្ចូល URL ជាមុនសិន។"

#. Translators: Status text shown next to the Test URL button while the check is in progress.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeradio\radioDialog.py:8851
msgid "Checking…"
msgstr "កំពុងពិនិត្យ…"

#. Translators: Spoken when the URL check starts.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeradio\radioDialog.py:8853
msgid "Checking stream URL, please wait…"
msgstr "កំពុងពិនិត្យ URL ស្ទ្រីម សូមរង់ចាំ…"

#. Translators: Status text shown next to the Test URL button when the stream checked out as playable; the '✓' is a visual checkmark, not meant to be read as punctuation.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeradio\radioDialog.py:8867
msgid "✓ Stream reachable"
msgstr "✓ អាចចូលប្រើស្ទ្រីមបាន"

#. Translators: Spoken when the stream check succeeds.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeradio\radioDialog.py:8870
msgid "Stream is reachable."
msgstr "អាចចូលប្រើស្ទ្រីមបាន។"

#. Translators: Status text shown when the stream check failed; the '✗' is a visual cross mark, %s is the specific error from check_stream_url().
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeradio\radioDialog.py:8873
#, python-format
msgid "✗ %s"
msgstr "✗ %s"

#. Translators: Spoken when the stream check fails; %s is the specific error from check_stream_url().
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeradio\radioDialog.py:8876
#, python-format
msgid "Stream check failed: %s"
msgstr "ការពិនិត្យស្ទ្រីមបរាជ័យ៖ %s"

#. Translators: Title of the dialog for editing an existing scheduled recording; %s is the station name.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeradio\radioDialog.py:8894
#, python-format
msgid "Edit Schedule — %s"
msgstr "កែសម្រួលកាលវិភាគ — %s"

#. Translators: 'Save' button label; commits the edited schedule entry.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeradio\radioDialog.py:8978
msgid "&Save"
msgstr "រក្សាទុក &S"

#. Translators: Fallback episode title used for the downloaded filename if the currently playing episode has no name.
#. Translators: Field-name row header in this dialog's podcast-episode details table; value is the episode title.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeradio\recordingMixin.py:44
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeradio\trackInfoMixin.py:831
msgid "Episode"
msgstr "ភាគ"

#. Translators: Spoken when trying to download the current podcast episode but it has no resolvable URL.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeradio\recordingMixin.py:48
msgid "This episode has no downloadable URL."
msgstr "ភាគនេះគ្មាន URL សម្រាប់ទាញយកទេ។"

#. Translators: Name of an NVDA command (Ctrl+Win+E); single-press toggles a plain instant recording, double-press toggles song-capture recording instead - see this method's logic below.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeradio\recordingMixin.py:74
msgid "Start or stop instant recording"
msgstr "ចាប់ផ្តើម ឬបញ្ឈប់ដំណើរការថតភ្លាមៗ"

#. Translators: Spoken when the user manually ends an in-progress song-capture recording (double-press Ctrl+Win+E while capturing); %s is the saved filename.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeradio\recordingMixin.py:102
#, python-format
msgid "Song recording stopped: %s"
msgstr "ការ​ថត​បទចម្រៀង​បាន​បញ្ឈប់: %s"

#. Translators: Fallback spoken when song-capture is stopped but no output path was returned (e.g. nothing was actually captured).
#. Translators: Fallback spoken when auto-stop finds nothing to save (e.g. capture just started).
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeradio\recordingMixin.py:106
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeradio\trackInfoMixin.py:1224
msgid "Song recording stopped"
msgstr "ការ​ថត​បទចម្រៀង​បាន​បញ្ឈប់"

#. Translators: Spoken when double-pressing Ctrl+Win+E (song-capture) on a podcast/audiobook episode, which can't be recorded this way; points to the Ctrl+Win+V download command instead.
#. Translators: Same message as the song-capture path above, spoken here when single-pressing Ctrl+Win+E on a podcast/audiobook episode.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeradio\recordingMixin.py:140
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeradio\recordingMixin.py:225
msgid ""
"Podcast or audiobook cannot be recorded. To download the episode or book, "
"press Ctrl+Win+V."
msgstr "ផតខាស់ ឬសៀវភៅជាសំឡេង មិនអាចថតបានទេ។ ដើម្បីទាញយកភាគ ឬសៀវភៅ សូមចុច Ctrl+Win+V។"

#. Translators: Spoken when double-pressing Ctrl+Win+E (song-capture) on a jukebox track, which is already a local file.
#. Translators: Same message as the song-capture path above, spoken here when single-pressing Ctrl+Win+E on a jukebox track.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeradio\recordingMixin.py:149
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeradio\recordingMixin.py:233
msgid "Jukebox tracks are already local files and cannot be recorded."
msgstr "បទនៅក្នុង jukebox ជាឯកសារមូលដ្ឋានរួចហើយ ដូច្នេះមិនអាចថតបានទេ។"

#. Translators: Spoken when trying to start song-capture recording on a station with no ICY track-title metadata, so there's no song boundary to record against.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeradio\recordingMixin.py:167
msgid ""
"This station does not broadcast track metadata. Song recording is not "
"available."
msgstr ""
"ស្ថានីយវិទ្យុនេះមិនផ្សាយទិន្នន័យមេតានៃបទចម្រៀង ឬតន្ត្រីទេ។ "
"ដំណើរការថតបទចម្រៀងមិនអាចចាប់ផ្ដើមបានទេ។"

#. Translators: Spoken when song-capture recording starts; %s is the current ICY track title (artist/song) being captured.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeradio\recordingMixin.py:180
#, python-format
msgid "Song recording started: %s"
msgstr "ដំណើរការថតបទចម្រៀងបានចាប់ផ្តើមហើយ: %s"

#. Translators: Generic fallback spoken if starting song-capture recording raises an unexpected exception.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeradio\recordingMixin.py:185
msgid "Could not start song recording"
msgstr "មិនអាចចាប់ផ្តើមដំណើរការថតបទចម្រៀងបានទេ"

#. Translators: Spoken when the single-press gesture stops an in-progress plain instant recording; %s is the saved filename.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeradio\recordingMixin.py:215
#, python-format
msgid "Recording stopped: %s"
msgstr "ដំណើរការថតបានបញ្ឈប់ហើយ: %s"

#. Translators: Fallback spoken when a recording is stopped but no output path was returned.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeradio\recordingMixin.py:218
msgid "Recording stopped"
msgstr "ដំណើរការថតបានបញ្ឈប់ហើយ"

#. Translators: Spoken when a plain instant recording starts (single-press Ctrl+Win+E); %s is the station name.
#. Translators: Spoken when a scheduled or manual recording begins; %s is the station name.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeradio\recordingMixin.py:245
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeradio\__init__.py:567
#, python-format
msgid "Recording started: %s"
msgstr "ដំណើរការថតបានចាប់ផ្ដើមហើយ: %s"

#. Translators: Generic fallback spoken if starting an instant recording raises an unexpected exception.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeradio\recordingMixin.py:249
msgid "Could not start recording"
msgstr "មិនអាចចាប់ផ្តើមដំណើរការថតបានទេ"

#. Translators: Name of an NVDA command (Ctrl+Win+W); opens the configured recordings folder in File Explorer.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeradio\recordingMixin.py:256
msgid "Open FreeRadio recordings folder"
msgstr "បើកឯកសារថតរបស់ FreeRadio"

#. Translators: Spoken when the Ctrl+Win+W shortcut can't open the recordings folder in Explorer; %s is the underlying error.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeradio\recordingMixin.py:271
#, python-format
msgid "Could not open recordings folder: %s"
msgstr "មិនអាចបើកឯកសារថតបានទេ: %s"

#. Translators: Checkbox label for the time-shift/rewind feature setting.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeradio\settingsPanel.py:89
msgid ""
"&Enable time-shift buffer (rewind live radio, no effect on podcasts and "
"audio books)"
msgstr ""
"បើក&តំបន់ផ្ទុកបណ្ដោះអាសន្នសម្រាប់ប្ដូរពេលវេលា (រំកិលថយក្រោយវិទ្យុផ្ទាល់ គ្មានឥទ្ធិពលលើផតខាស់ "
"និងសៀវភៅជាសំឡេង)"

#. Translators: Label for the time-shift buffer-length choice control.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeradio\settingsPanel.py:97
msgid "Time-shift buffer duration:"
msgstr "រយៈពេលនៃតំបន់ផ្ទុកបណ្ដោះអាសន្នសម្រាប់ប្ដូរពេលវេលា៖"

#. Translators: Choices for the time-shift buffer-duration control, in the same order as self._timeshift_duration_seconds just above (continues on the next line).
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeradio\settingsPanel.py:103
msgid "10 minutes"
msgstr "១០ នាទី"

#: addon\globalPlugins\freeradio\settingsPanel.py:103
msgid "30 minutes"
msgstr "៣០ នាទី"

#: addon\globalPlugins\freeradio\settingsPanel.py:103
msgid "1 hour"
msgstr "១ ម៉ោង"

#: addon\globalPlugins\freeradio\settingsPanel.py:104
msgid "2 hours"
msgstr "២ ម៉ោង"

#: addon\globalPlugins\freeradio\settingsPanel.py:104
msgid "5 hours"
msgstr "៥ ម៉ោង"

#. Translators: Grey explanatory hint shown under the buffer-duration choice, warning about disk usage for long buffers.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeradio\settingsPanel.py:117
msgid ""
"Longer buffers use more temporary disk space, especially for high-bitrate "
"stations — a 5-hour buffer can use several gigabytes."
msgstr ""
"តំបន់ផ្ទុកបណ្ដោះអាសន្នដែលវែងជាងនេះ ប្រើប្រាស់ទំហំថាសបណ្ដោះអាសន្នកាន់តែច្រើន "
"ជាពិសេសសម្រាប់ស្ថានីយ៍ដែលមានអត្រាប៊ីតខ្ពស់ — តំបន់ផ្ទុកបណ្ដោះអាសន្នរយៈពេល ៥ "
"ម៉ោងអាចប្រើបានច្រើនជីហ្គាបៃ។"

#. --- Audio output device (BASS only) ---
#. (index, name) list — populated from BASS
#. Translators: Label for the main output-device choice in Settings (same purpose as the in-dialog device picker, but persisted here).
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeradio\settingsPanel.py:126
msgid "Audio output device (BASS backend):"
msgstr "ឧបករណ៍បញ្ចេញសំឡេង (BASS backend):"

#. Translators: Placeholder shown in the device choice control while devices are still being fetched from BASS in the background.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeradio\settingsPanel.py:131
msgid "Loading devices..."
msgstr "កំពុងដំណើរការឧបករណ៍..."

#. Translators: Label for the choice between the two device-list refresh strategies below.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeradio\settingsPanel.py:136
msgid "Audio device refresh mode (BASS backend):"
msgstr "របៀបធ្វើឱ្យឧបករណ៍អូឌីយ៉ូស្រស់ (BASS backend):"

#. Translators: One of the two audio-device refresh modes: always re-query BASS for current device numbers, slower but accurate if devices changed since NVDA started.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeradio\settingsPanel.py:143
msgid "Reliable, refresh device numbers live"
msgstr "គួរឱ្យទុកចិត្ត ធ្វើឱ្យលេខឧបករណ៍ស្រស់ភ្លាមៗ"

#. Translators: The other refresh mode: use the device list BASS already has cached, faster but can be stale if devices were plugged/unplugged.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeradio\settingsPanel.py:145
msgid "Fast, use current BASS device list"
msgstr "លឿន ប្រើបញ្ជីឧបករណ៍ BASS បច្ចុប្បន្ន"

#. Translators: Label for the default-volume spin control.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeradio\settingsPanel.py:157
msgid "Volume (0-100):"
msgstr "កម្រិតសំឡេង (0-100):"

#. --- Audio effects (BASS only) ---
#. Translators: Section heading above the audio-effects checklist and EQ controls.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeradio\settingsPanel.py:166
msgid "Audio Effects (BASS backend only):"
msgstr "បែបផែនសំឡេង (BASS backend only):"

#. Translators: Label for the audio-effects checklist control.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeradio\settingsPanel.py:188
msgid "Audio &effects:"
msgstr "បែបផែនសំឡេង &e"

#. Translators: Labels for the three EQ gain spin controls, shown only for whichever bands are checked above (continues for treble and vocal on the next two lines).
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeradio\settingsPanel.py:202
msgid "&Bass gain (dB):"
msgstr "ការ&ពង្រឹងសំឡេងទំនាប (dB):"

#: addon\globalPlugins\freeradio\settingsPanel.py:203
msgid "&Treble gain (dB):"
msgstr "ការ&ពង្រឹងសំឡេងខ្ពស់ (dB):"

#: addon\globalPlugins\freeradio\settingsPanel.py:204
msgid "&Vocal gain (dB):"
msgstr "ការ&ពង្រឹងសំឡេងមនុស្ស (dB):"

#. Translators: Label for the station-switch transition (crossfade) choice control.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeradio\settingsPanel.py:219
msgid "Station &switch transition (BASS backend only):"
msgstr "ការផ្លាស់ប្តូរស្ថានីយវិទ្យុ (BASS backend only): &s"

#. Translators: Checkbox label for auto-resuming the last-played station when NVDA starts.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeradio\settingsPanel.py:240
msgid "&Resume last station on NVDA startup"
msgstr "បន្តស្ថានីយ៍វិទ្យុចុងក្រោយនៅពេលចាប់ផ្តើមកម្មវិធី NVDA &R"

#. Translators: Label for the choice between NVDA's own synth and a separate SAPI5 voice for track-change announcements.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeradio\settingsPanel.py:255
msgid "Track change &voice:"
msgstr "តាមដានការផ្លាស់ប្តូរសំឡេង: &v"

#. Translators: The two voice-source choices for track-change announcements: NVDA's current synthesizer, or a separately selected SAPI5 voice.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeradio\settingsPanel.py:260
msgid "NVDA"
msgstr "NVDA"

#: addon\globalPlugins\freeradio\settingsPanel.py:260
msgid "SAPI5"
msgstr "SAPI5"

#. SAPI5 voice selector — populated on a background thread to avoid blocking UI.
#. Translators: Label for the specific SAPI5 voice picker, enabled only when SAPI5 is chosen above.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeradio\settingsPanel.py:272
msgid "SAPI5 &voice:"
msgstr "សំឡេង SAPI5: &v"

#. Translators: Placeholder/first entry in the SAPI5 voice list, meaning 'use whatever the system's default SAPI5 voice is' rather than a specific named voice.
#. Translators: First entry in the SAPI5 voice list once real voices have loaded, meaning 'use the system default SAPI5 voice'.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeradio\settingsPanel.py:275
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeradio\settingsPanel.py:292
msgid "Default (system)"
msgstr "លំនាំដើម (system)"

#. Translators: Checkbox label for the mute-notifications setting (same feature as the toggleMuteNotifications command).
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeradio\settingsPanel.py:321
msgid "&Mute notifications (station changes, playback, recording)"
msgstr "បិទការជូនដំណឹង (station changes, playback, recording) &M"

#. Translators: Checkbox label for whether FreeRadio notifications also show on a connected braille display.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeradio\settingsPanel.py:331
msgid "&Show FreeRadio messages on the braille display"
msgstr "បង្ហាញសារ FreeRadio នៅលើឧបករណ៍បង្ហាញអក្សរប្រៃយ៍ &S"

#. Translators: Label for the choice controlling what a single Ctrl+Win+P press does when nothing is currently playing.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeradio\settingsPanel.py:347
msgid "When Ctrl+Win+P is pressed with no active playback:"
msgstr "នៅពេលដែល Ctrl+Win+P ត្រូវបានចុច គឺវាគ្មានសកម្មភាពចាក់នោះទេ:"

#. Translators: The two choices for a single Ctrl+Win+P press with nothing playing: resume where playback left off, or open the favourites list to pick something.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeradio\settingsPanel.py:350
msgid "Resume last station"
msgstr "បន្តស្ថានីយវិទ្យុចុងក្រោយទៀត"

#: addon\globalPlugins\freeradio\settingsPanel.py:351
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeradio\settingsPanel.py:366
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeradio\settingsPanel.py:390
msgid "Open favourites list"
msgstr "បើកបញ្ជីចំណូលចិត្ត"

#. Translators: Label for the choice controlling what a double Ctrl+Win+P press does.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeradio\settingsPanel.py:362
msgid "When Ctrl+Win+P is pressed twice:"
msgstr "នៅពេលដែល Ctrl+Win+P ត្រូវបានចុចពីរដង:"

#. Translators: Choices for what a double/triple Ctrl+Win+P press can do - each opens a different FreeRadio tab or performs a quick action; this same nine-item list is reused for both the double-press and triple-press settings (continues for the next eight lines).
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeradio\settingsPanel.py:365
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeradio\settingsPanel.py:389
msgid "Do nothing"
msgstr "គ្មានសកម្មភាពអ្វីទាំងអស់"

#: addon\globalPlugins\freeradio\settingsPanel.py:367
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeradio\settingsPanel.py:391
msgid "Open station search"
msgstr "បើកការស្វែងរកស្ថានីយ៍វិទ្យុ"

#: addon\globalPlugins\freeradio\settingsPanel.py:368
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeradio\settingsPanel.py:392
msgid "Open recording tab"
msgstr "បើកផ្ទាំងថត"

#: addon\globalPlugins\freeradio\settingsPanel.py:369
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeradio\settingsPanel.py:393
msgid "Open timer tab"
msgstr "បើកផ្ទាំងកម្មវិធីកំណត់ម៉ោង"

#: addon\globalPlugins\freeradio\settingsPanel.py:370
