"&Disable internet connectivity check before playing (recommended if DNS is "
"blocked)"
msgstr "បិទការត្រួតពិនិត្យការតភ្ជាប់អ៊ីនធឺណិតមុនពេលចាក់ (recommended if DNS is blocked) &D"

